order by onepercent desc, unique1 desc;
 onepercent  | unique1 
-------------+---------
             |    -666
  2147483647 |    -666
 -2147483648 |    -666
(3 rows)

EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS, TIMING OFF, SUMMARY OFF)
